                                            {
                                                "example_id": "375e17a8-1e2a-413a-802b-d1ca46040a27",
                                                "sense_id": "a65e3ee7-3b44-34fc-8b0c-23546e3d92fd",
                                                "text": "And interestingly, many cosmeticians predict that high-def could actually reduce the amount of plastic surgery in Hollywood, because the tiny seams look Frankensteinian at such high resolution."
